STAR DEFENDER - Gallery Shooter

CONTROLS
- Left / Right arrow keys (or A / D): move your ship along the bottom of the screen
- Space: fire laser (hold to auto-fire)
- Enter: restart after Game Over

THEMING / SCORING
Space theme. You defend Earth from waves of alien ships.
- Grunt (black ship): 10 points, 1 hit to destroy. Stays in formation and fires straight down.
- Diver (red ship): 30 points, 2 hits to destroy. Periodically peels off from the
  formation, swoops down a curved path toward you, fires aimed shots, then re-enters
  from the top of the screen.
- You have 5 health (hearts, top right). Enemy lasers cost 1 health; ramming a diver
  costs 1 health. You are briefly invulnerable (blinking) after a hit.
- Score is shown top left. Clearing all enemies shows "WAVE CLEARED", pauses, then
  repeats the same level layout with slightly faster, more frequent enemy fire.
- When health reaches 0, a Game Over screen shows your score; press Enter to reset.

Downloaded most from Space Shooter Redux
